          {
            "text": "场 pronounced chǎng counts events such as games or performances. It is not a generic counter for every action.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "今天有一场比赛。",
                "pinyin": "jīntiān yǒu yī chǎng bǐsài 。",
                "meaning": "There is a match today.",
